id: ops-release-diagnosis-propagation
title: Propagate current release diagnosis and continuation identity fixes through canonical callers
description: "Follow docs/release-diagnosis-propagation.md: 37 copied release workflows require migration through the canonical caller/template path to a reviewed released pm-ops SHA. Current pm-ops uses the local reusable caller and receives all three fixes after merge. No external reusable callers were found in the 38-package inventory; future SHA-pinned callers require pin updates. Track adoption here without per-repository items."
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-ops#272"
