claim_principal: codex-ops272-1114
author: codex-ops268-1112
comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-13T00:21:20.510Z",codex-ops268-1112,"Inventory verified through current-main GitHub contents reads after local checkout inspection: 37 copied release.yml workflows plus pm-ops using its local reusable daily-release.yml. No external reusable callers found in these 38 package release workflows. Only pm-ops changes here; follow docs/release-diagnosis-propagation.md for adoption. Keep this single follow-up open; do not create per-package items."
  "2026-11-14T03:56:27.639Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Investigating canonical item-less release windows and superseded-PR behavior before exactly two TypeScript pilots. Awaiting a released tag newer than v2026.11.11; no unreleased pin, merge, release dispatch or publication is authorized. Current npm docs validate the calling workflow filename; live token-exchange evidence remains required."
  "2026-11-14T03:58:49.098Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Behavioral baseline: build and build:test passed; changelog, daily planning, workflow and continuation adapter tests passed 139/139. A new real tracker plus dependency-only Git window executes the actual reusable changelog step with ordinary consumer pm-changelog scripts: it failed MISSING_REQUESTED_RELEASE before the fix. The canonical self-caller masks this with package-owned include-empty; shared workflow now passes --include-empty consistently to generation, drift check and notes. Existing unchanged-tree and published-today decisions remain release blockers. Existing superseded closure re-reads successor and older PR ownership, retires receipts, names the successor, and closes only owned PRs."
  "2026-11-14T04:05:43.420Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Decision table for #272:\n| Part | Evidence | Decision |\n| (a) Item-less windows | New real tracker + dependency-only Git commit executes the parsed reusable workflow step. Baseline fails MISSING_REQUESTED_RELEASE; forwarding --include-empty to the three pm-changelog hooks passes. pm test also passed 1/1. | Fix at pm-ops workflow layer; no pm-changelog change. Preserve unchanged-tree and daily publication caps. |\n| (b) Superseded PRs | Initial targeted suite 139/139, including owned-only cleanup, successor receipt re-read, retirement and failed-close recovery. | Existing canonical behavior is sufficient. |\n| (c) Cross-repository OIDC | Current npm docs validate caller release.yml. Exact local preflight exits 1 because this session has no Actions OIDC endpoint. The prerequisite self-caller request job accepted the pm-ops identity at 04:04:01Z: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-ops/actions/runs/43553624308/job/132323825169. This is same-repository proof only. | Cross-repository live receipt still required before activation; absence is not rejection, so no copied-workflow fallback. |\nPilots selected: pm-lint and pm-jira, both with include-empty already in package scripts. Preserve pm-lint string-valued approval/exact repository/main gate and pm-jira release:update-version. Both already cover github-actions in Dependabot. Await new pm-ops release before editing/pinning either workflow. Remaining rollout: 34 authorized packages listed in docs/release-diagnosis-propagation.md; exclude pm-cli, preserve package hooks, run caller/attestation/YAML/actionlint/changelog and exact-head CI checks in small batches. Only orchestrator merges and dispatches."
  "2026-11-14T04:27:12.949Z",codex-ops272-1114,"Canonical gates passed: npm run release:check and bun run release:check each reported 1672 passed, 2 skipped, 0 failed (1674 total). Both measured statements/branches/functions/lines at 100% across the configured 48 source files; production and release-runtime audits found zero vulnerabilities. Bun used isolated HOME and Git configuration. The two skips are opt-in configured-real-repository scans, not either feature proof. New dependency-only test failed on the unchanged three invocations and passed directly and through pm test after forwarding include-empty. Both unchanged proposed pilots pass npm run changelog:check. Actionlint v1.7.12 passes the thin caller template; canonical shared workflow has the same ten existing schema diagnostics as unchanged main. Added content privacy and append-only history-prefix checks pass. Preparing the canonical fix PR while waiting for a newer release: run 43553624308 succeeded and created release PR #274, whose CI and CodeQL are action_required. No pilot workflow has been changed and no released pin has been selected."
